stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingApproval: Loan.Create (POST /api/bank/loans), TotalDue frozen
    PendingApproval --> Active: Approve(now) on LoanApprovedEvent, DueOn = now + Term
    PendingApproval --> Rejected: Reject(reason) on LoanRejectedEvent
    PendingApproval --> Rejected: Reject("Approval timed out") by BankKeeper after ApprovalTimeout
    Active --> CollectionPending: RequestCollection by BankKeeper at DueOn or by POST repayments
    Overdue --> CollectionPending: RequestCollection retried every CollectionRetryInterval
    CollectionPending --> Repaid: ApplyCollection covers the whole Outstanding
    CollectionPending --> Active: partial collection requested before DueOn, no penalty
    CollectionPending --> Overdue: partial collection at or past DueOn, one-time penalty on the remainder
    CollectionPending --> Active: AbortCollection by BankKeeper after CollectionPendingTimeout, never overdue before
    CollectionPending --> Overdue: AbortCollection by BankKeeper after CollectionPendingTimeout, OverdueSince already set
    Repaid --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    note right of PendingApproval
        filtered unique index keeps one loan
        per user while Status IN (0, 1, 2, 3)
        (Rejected and Repaid free the slot)
    end note
    note right of Overdue
        penalty charged exactly once,
        guarded by OverdueSince == null,
        new loans blocked until Repaid
    end note
